tures for XGBoost training (keeping the same training/validation split). This semi-supervised approach helps XGBoost adapt to test-domain patterns without overfitting, as per the initial plan's Change #2. Implementation: in the n-gram extraction section, concat X_train_texts with test_sample_texts before fitting char_vectorizer_short/med/long."}, "parse_success": true, "raw_response": "{
